---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import DownloadButton from '../components/DownloadButton.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Update WhisperFree — One-Time Manual Update"
  description="A one-time manual update is needed to keep WhisperFree updating automatically. Download the latest version and replace your current app — your settings and permissions carry over."
  noindex={true}
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="pt-16">
    <section class="py-20 px-6">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 mb-3">Update available</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">A quick one-time update</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8">
          You&rsquo;ll need to reinstall WhisperFree once to get the next
          version. It takes under a minute, and everything you&rsquo;ve set up
          carries over.
        </p>

        <DownloadButton size="lg" />
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-3">Free &middot; macOS 14.0+ &middot; Apple Silicon</p>

        <!-- How to install -->
        <div class="mt-12 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 text-left">
          <p class="font-semibold mb-3">Three quick steps</p>
          <ol class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-2 list-decimal list-inside">
            <li>Click <strong>Download</strong> above.</li>
            <li>Open the downloaded file and drag WhisperFree into <strong>Applications</strong>. Click <strong>Replace</strong> when your Mac asks.</li>
            <li>Open WhisperFree. That&rsquo;s it &mdash; automatic updates are back on.</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">
            If your hotkey doesn&rsquo;t respond right after updating, quit
            WhisperFree and open it again &mdash; that usually fixes it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
